                                                "sense_id": "7b597854-049f-33c4-a8e5-782ef91a8a16",
                                                "text": "In fact, apian, formican, vespal, and termital government is not a monarchy, but a pure democracy. The queens of ants, bees, wasps, and termites wear the crown of maternity — no other."
